ge\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://www.nodiatis.com/pub/21.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a></div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2451-windrave","name":"Windrave","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2451_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"85"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-08-28T16:42:23-07:00","id":243487,"title":"","content":"Reports are coming in that some people are getting their books without getting an email/tracking number.<br /> <br /> Also is it the mail or UPS?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1250-shadowlost","name":"Shadowlost","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1250_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"155"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-08-28T17:43:12-07:00","id":243500,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>miss_minty</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/232989-getting-dtd-prestige-edition?p=243358#post243358\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">That gives me hope I'll get mine in a timely manner. Considering there is no post this coming Monday. Nofather would you answer these two questions for me?<br /> What state do you live in?<br /> Which mail service delivered your books UPS, USPS, FedEx, or DHL? My Mail-Lady already came by today so I'm hoping it's not USPS,</div> </div> </div> </div>North Carolina right now.<br /> <br /> I'm not exactly sure, as I wasn't there when it came. But it arrived around noon, which is when the USPS guy comes, while I got a package via UPS later in the afternoon.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/886-nofather","name":"nofather","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar886_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11016"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-08-28T18:44:53-07:00","id":243519,"title":"","content":"There were some concerns raised over on the Kickstarter page on the quality of the packaging. Another backer received a copy with an embossing error. Anyone else have any issues with either?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/361-brighthand","name":"Brighthand","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"13"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-08-28T19:18:49-07:00","id":243544,"title":"","content":"Neither a package nor a tracking number. But I fear that my distance to NC will be the cause of a great delay. I really would have liked the Peace of Mind of some tracking info through.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1064-miss_minty","name":"miss_minty","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"283"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-08-28T19:46:33-07:00","id":243548,"title":"","content":"Mine was wrapped in a sort of cardboardish mesh and paper and tightly packaged. I think the only problem might have been if it was left in a puddle or, like, gouged. Which mine wasn't.<br /> I don't have an embossing error, either.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/886-nofather","name":"nofather","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar886_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11016"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-08-28T21:05:04-07:00","id":243596,"title":"","content":"US distribution of small parcels is pretty poor by global standards. I work for a multinational that distributes from AU to 3rd party Warehouses who then fulfill orders in various regions by utilizing local parcel services.<br /> By far the US has the most problems with damage and at a high cost per parcel and with slow delivery speeds.<br /> <br /> As a buyer of DTRPG products, I am glad mine get shipped from the UK most of the time, not the US, as the delivery time from UK is about 3 weeks quicker than anything I have shipped from the US.<br /> Another example, I get free shipping from <a href=\"http://www.bookdepository.com/\" target=\"_blank\">http://www.bookdepository.com/</a> and have a book on my door step within a week.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/142-thiassi","name":"Thiassi","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar142_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"25"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-08-29T10:35:09-07:00","id":244145,"title":"","content":"Part of the problem with package care in the US stems from how much the postal workers are paid. (Not much.) Combined with a stressful work environment and constant cutbacks its lends to dissatisfied employee's who think its only fair to treat your parcels like they feel they are being treated. But we aren't talking about USPS delivery with these books.. we're talking about UPS which is a private parcel service. So the excuses as to why the problems exist in USPS generally don't mesh as well.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\"><a href=\"http://www.nodiatis.com/personality.htm\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://www.nodiatis.com/pub/21.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a></div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2451-windrave","name":"Windrave","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2451_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"85"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-08-29T10:42:04-07:00","id":244168,"title":"","content":"Got mine just an hour ago.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>nWoD Warhammer Fantasy RPG,<br /> WoD Wraith: The Oblivion<br /> and Infernum-style Demon: The Descent, Shadows of Abaddon --&gt; <a href=\"http://madnessforums.com/forums/index.php/topic,26.0.html\" target=\"_blank\">http://madnessforums.com/forums/inde...opic,26.0.html</a><br /> <img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.com/i/idnSdTJkj\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/974-mrparaduo","name":"MrParaduo","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar974_2.jpeg","title":"Me