ly considering Demon, until I open the box it's both completely perfect and an absolute wreck.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Kelly R.S. Steele, Freelance Writer(Feel free to call me Kelly, Arcane, or Arc)</b><br /> The world is not beautiful, therefore it is.-Keiichi Sigsawa, Kino's Journey<br /> Feminine pronouns, please.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/99-arcanearts","name":"ArcaneArts","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar99_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11384"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-08-30T08:36:06-07:00","id":244825,"title":"","content":"I just can't wrap my head around the fact that everyone else's book will be old news by the time I get mine. I wonder how long the Europeans have to wait.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1064-miss_minty","name":"miss_minty","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"283"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-08-30T08:41:48-07:00","id":244827,"title":"","content":"Well, yeah. I'm not too thrilled about that either.<br /> <br /> But to be fair, the people who are reporting it in also live closer to the shipping location. THe time difference is weird as hell, but at least it's reasonable in approximation.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Kelly R.S. Steele, Freelance Writer(Feel free to call me Kelly, Arcane, or Arc)</b><br /> The world is not beautiful, therefore it is.-Keiichi Sigsawa, Kino's Journey<br /> Feminine pronouns, please.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/99-arcanearts","name":"ArcaneArts","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar99_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11384"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-08-30T09:42:18-07:00","id":244850,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>pgolasze13</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/232989-getting-dtd-prestige-edition?p=244823#post244823\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I just got my tracking number, came the day after my book came in.</div> </div> </div> </div>Yeah. I got the email this morning after getting the book yesterday.<br /> <br /> Seems a bit odd.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/617-heavy-arms","name":"Heavy Arms","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar617_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"12634"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-08-30T09:45:43-07:00","id":244852,"title":"","content":"Received my tracking number this morning, and just got the book delivery a few minutes ago. Northern Massachusetts, US. The packaging seems okay to me, not luxurious but better than the packaging for the PoD books I've gotten from Drivethru or for the books I ordered from Amazon during the traditional publishing days. My book has no damage (although it's easy to mistake the shattered-glass texturing added to the cover for wrinkles at points), and it's the prettiest White Wolf/Onyx Path book I've gotten since the Changeling core. I'm happy.<br /> <br /> Here's a reminder for everyone: Kickstarter has a little checkbox for you to check in your profile's Backer History when you've received your Kickstarted item, which I imagine in this case would primarily be the printed core and anything else in your reward tier. Don't leave Onyx Path with false negatives!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":522,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/522-stupid-loserman","user":"Stupid Loserman","date":". 08-30-2014, 12:47 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/522-stupid-loserman","name":"Stupid Loserman","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar522_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1824"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-08-30T10:33:43-07:00","id":244871,"title":"","content":"Just got my Tracking Number this morning. Looks like I'll be getting my copy on <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Thursday, 09/04/2014, By End of Day</span></span> </div> </div> </div>. I'm honestly still excited. I am not quite sure why most people are unhappy.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://www.kickstarter.com/projects/200664283/demon-the-descent-prestige-edition\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://img513.imageshack.us/img513/4478/8vno.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a><br /> Frequent Story Teller for the Circle of Five gaming group.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/654-xiongrey","name":"xiongrey","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar654_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"549"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-08-30T10:56:07-07:00","id":244881,"title":"","content":"Hah! I just got my tracking number.. way to be late to the party!","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\"><a href=\"http://www.nodiatis.com/personality.htm\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://www.nodiatis.com/pub/21.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a></div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2451-windrave","name":"Windrave","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2451_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"85"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-08-30T11:55:30-07:00","id":244918,"title":"","content":"I also just got my tracking number. I enjoy that it says it was shipped today, but it definitely got here yesterday.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3776-autodefenestrate","name":"AutoDefenestrate","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3776_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"120"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-08-30T12:43:14-07:00","id":244940,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Windrave</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/232989-getting-dtd-prestige-edition?p=244770#post244770\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">This wouldn't be nearly as intolerable as it is if they bothered to get all the tracking numbers out like they said they were. My book was largely undamaged.. I say largely because the corners look like they might have been bumped a little.. but nothing beyond reason. Still, the book was NOT sent via typical media mail service.. and was in fact.. in an ordinary box. It should have been sent in one meant more for books.. or at least packed tighter than it was.<br /> <br /> (I regret throwing away the packing material.. as I would have took pictures to show you.)</div> </div> </div> </div>You have gotten the tracking numbers after the books shipped, just like they said they would and I reported in the Updates. Some books got there before the numbers because they have to send the packages out in waves. This is also why some already have them and some don't, the day they sent out those specific packages and the distance involved. As for not using Media Mail, no we did not. We wanted to have better packaging and better service. There are ALWAYS some books damaged a tad. That weird packaging is actually designed to minimize the damage. I haven't gotten an unbent corner book from Amazon in years and they are number one and I wanted to make our shipping better than that. Thanks!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5-richt","name":"RichT","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5_2.jpeg","title":"Onyx Path Creative Director","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"505"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-08-30T13:02:14-07:00","id":244948,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>ArcaneArts</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/232989-getting-dtd-prestige-edition?p=244827#post244827\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Well, yeah. I'm not too thrilled about that either.<br /> <br /> But to be fair, the people who are reporting it in also live closer to the shipping location. THe time difference is weird as hell, but at least it's reasonable in approximation.</div> </div> </div> </div> True, and we're far enough that we have to suffer with the lack of post on Labor day, so I suppose if trucks are moving our could be here as early as Thursday. So long as they come safe and secure I could be happy. But the wait. The wait!<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1064-miss_minty","name":"miss_minty","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"283"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-08-30T13:08:49-07:00","id":244951,"title":"","content":"Got mine, relatively undamaged. Woo!","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Mage the Awakening 2e Communal Homebrew Threads:<br /> - <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/966394-perils-of-the-path-post-your-homebrew\" target=\"_blank\">Perils of the Path</a> - Other homebrew threads linked in the OP!<br /> <br /> Join us at the unofficial IRC channels on.irc.sorcery.net at #exalted and now #theonyxpath!","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/451-kirby-jerusalem","name":"Kirby Jerusalem","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar451_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"589"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-08-30T17:25:32-07:00","id":245077,"title":"","content":"Honestly as far as the damage goes, I didn't notice it until I felt a bit of creasing at the top of one of the middle pages.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3776-autodefenestrate","name":"AutoDefenestrate","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3776_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"120"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-08-30T17:37:31-07:00","id":245081,"title":"","content":"I got mine. I'm amazed at how the embossing turned out! It really looks like shattered glass!","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Mage: the Ascension - <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1191028-redesigned-prime-sphere\" target=\"_blank\">Redesigned Prime Sphere</a>; <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1188769-simpler-wonder-creation\" target=\"_blank\">Streamlined Wonder Creation</a><br /> Mummy: the Curse - <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mummy-the-curse/474927-mummy-the-curse-2e-conversion\" target=\"_blank\">Lightweight 2E Conversion</a>; <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mummy-the-curse/22378-second-sight-tradition-disciples-of-duat\" target=\"_blank\">Disciples of Duat</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/61-octavo","name":"Octavo","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar61_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1171"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-08-30T18:48:40-07:00","id":245121,"title":"","content":"Got Mine, but it was damaged in transit. <a href=\"http://i.imgur.com/7fhxQMb.jpg\" target=\"_blank\">http://i.imgur.com/7fhxQMb.jpg</a>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1136-wolfgar","name":"Wolfgar","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1136_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"646"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-08-30T18:55:30-07:00","id":245122,"title":"","content":"I just got my tracking number, I get the feeling because of the thread, or possibly other folks asking about it, they sent out tracking numbers to everyone who had theirs sent.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/886-nofather","name":"nofather","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar886_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11016"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-08-30T20:45:45-07:00","id":245159,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>nofather</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/232989-getting-dtd-prestige-edition?p=245122#post245122\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I just got my tracking number, I get the feeling because of the thread, or possibly other folks asking about it, they sent out tracking numbers to everyone who had theirs sent.</div> </div> </div> </div>The shipper said from the beginning that the tracking numbers would go out after they finished shipping everything. This thread or any other comments had nothing to do with them doing exactly what they said they'd do.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5-richt","name":"RichT","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5_2.jpeg","title":"Onyx Path Creative Director","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"505"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-08-30T21:16:47-07:00","id":245169,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Wolfgar</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/232989-getting-dtd-prestige-edition?p=245121#post245121\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Got Mine, but it was damaged in transit. <a href=\"http://i.imgur.com/7fhxQMb.jpg\" target=\"_blank\">http://i.imgur.com/7fhxQMb.jpg</a></div> </div> </div> </div> Oh wow. Was the binding or anything damaged?<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1064-miss_minty","name":"miss_minty","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"283"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-08-30T22:04:36-07:00","id":245187,"title":"","content":"There is a small tear that will eventually lead to the back cover being torn off, with enough continual use. The binding seems fine though, so that's a positive.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1136-wolfgar","name":"Wolfgar","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1136_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"646"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-08-31T00:40:50-07:00","id":245216,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>RichT</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/232989-getting-dtd-prestige-edition?p=245159#post245159\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">The shipper said from the beginning that the tracking numbers would go out after they finished shipping everything. This thread or any other comments had nothing to do with them doing exactly what they said they'd do.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> That'd do it too. Saves time on their end. It sounds like something we'd have been informed of and sure enough there it is on the Kickstarter message on the 22nd.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/886-nofather","name":"nofather","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar886_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11016"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-08-31T05:23:42-07:00","id":245286,"title":"","content":"This thread is weird. Its like one happy post and then one morose post leap-frogging one another. <br /> <br /> I live in the UK and I got the notice that my book had shipped yesterday. I'm expecting it to be at least a week before its likely to show up. However, I am kinda used to that, with living in across the Atlantic and all. <br /> <br /> I think something to keep in mind is that there were over 2000 Demon backers and while in the grand scheme of things that a pretty small order for a company to fill, its still a large group of people. Most of which are not posting on the forums in general and certainly not on this thread (which has 25 posters not including myself or the devs/writers/onyx path people who have commented). <br /> <br /> So we don't really know what % if completion the deliveries are at. Nor due to really know how common any damage is to the book. Some people have posted about receiving books that are fine, others have mentioned compression issues or warping of corners. As Rich said the damage issue is unavoidable basically, yes it sucks that some books are damaged, but so far non of the reported damage has been instantly destructive to the book. As in mostly cosmetic right? Also I am sure something can be done about it, maybe contact Rich if the damage is sever enough that is going to eventually make the book break/fall apart? <br /> <br /> The tracking numbers being &quot;late&quot; for some people is as Rich has explained due to the fact they don't send them out individually but all at once when shipping is complete. With an order of over 2000 dispatches I imagine that's standard bulk packaging procedure? After all sending out each tracking number individually when the package was dispatched would just slow the whole process down. Considering some people are already complaining about the time it will take to receive their books, surely that a good thing? <br /> <br /> I've only backed a few other Onyx Path Kickstarters before, Mummy the only one of them to have got the hardback book to me so far. With that it was a case of getting told it was sent to the shippers and then that they had the book, when about a month later it arrived in the post. Personally, I like getting a tracking number so this new company is already a step up from whoever they used for Mummy. <br /> <br /> Really, we all love this game or we would not be here right? We've waited 7-8 months (from the revised pdf version being released) for a hard copy, we've been great about expecting a realistic timescale for making a deluxe book from scratch. Kinda weird to complain about shipping times that make up the last 7-14 days of that period right? <br /> <br /> Sorry this post has wondered a bit. My point is that without knowing the general level of complete delivers to the ratio of damage we can't really say the shipper has done a &quot;bad job&quot; with the shipping (I mean they've packaged and shipped in order in about 3 weeks turn over, which is pretty fast, a week quicker then the company that packaged and shipped Mummy). I'm not saying anyone has outright said this yet, but its a vibe I am getting from this thread. <br /> <br /> In general I just want to say that we should stay positive! We either have or nearly have our deluxe copies of a game we all love.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#0000cd\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><i>&quot;There is no God in the Badlands.&quot; </i></span></span></span><span style=\"font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">- Sunny</span></span><br /> <br /> <img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.com/a/img824/1346/mosz.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /> <img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.com/a/img41/8167/obcp.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/599-hawthorn","name":"Hawthorn","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar599_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"511"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-08-31T08:47:29-07:00","id":245358,"title":"","content":"You can't use sound logic and sound reasoning on the internet. Now, flip a table, break a glass and yell obscenities to your neighbors like a normal person. ^.~","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1064-miss_minty","name":"miss_minty","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"283"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-08-31T09:03:32-07:00","id":245369,"title":"","content":"GOD DAMNIT MINTY, WHAT DO YOU THINK I'M FUCKING TRYING TO DO?<br /> <br /> Blegh. I don't like this game, Minty, can we change the rules?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Kelly R.S. Steele, Freelance Writer(Feel free to call me Kelly, Arcane, or Arc)</b><br /> The world is not beautiful, therefore it is.-Keiichi Sigsawa, Kino's Journey<br /> Feminine pronouns, please.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/99-arcanearts","name":"ArcaneArts","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar99_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11384"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-08-31T10:25:42-07:00","id":245431,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>miss_minty</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/232989-getting-dtd-prestige-edition?p=245358#post245358\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">You can't use sound logic and sound reasoning on the internet. Now, flip a table, break a glass and yell obscenities to your neighbors like a normal person. ^.~</div> </div> </div> </div>(\uff89\u0ca5\u76ca\u0ca5\uff09\uff89 \u253b\u2501\u253b","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1250-shadowlost","name":"Shadowlost","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1250_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"155"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-08-31T10:52:19-07:00","id":245460,"title":"","content":"Mine says it was shipped and delievered. But I had placed in a forward/change of address and the UPS information just says the following. I blame the God Machine for this.<br /> To:<br /> <b>TX, US</b><br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1110-unjustcustos","name":"UnjustCustos","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1110_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"46"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-08-31T12:41:08-07:00","id":245585,"title":"","content":"I like to imagine it traveling to the geographic center of Texas and the postal driver getting out of the truck, looking at the package and shrugging, just leaving it there. On a serious side, without a zip code, it'll probably be undeliverable. Maybe the change of address just made what came up in the UPS information spit out something partial.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3776-autodefenestrate","name":"AutoDefenestrate","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3776_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"120"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-08-31T13:03:17-07:00","id":245627,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>AutoDefenestrate</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/232989-getting-dtd-prestige-edition?p=245585#post245585\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I like to imagine it traveling to the geographic center of Texas and the postal driver getting out of the truck, looking at the package and shrugging, just leaving it there.</div> </div> </div> </div><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=KeWsPwwALus&amp;t=22m7s\" target=\"_blank\">&quot;I love the glory days when you could just take a package and write 'Canada' on it and it'll get here.&quot;</a>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:trebuchet ms\"><span style=\"color:#4B0082\"><b>Resident Lore-Hound</b></span><br /> Currently Consuming: <i>Demon: the Descent 1e</i></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/111-satchel","name":"Satchel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar111_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9828"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-08-31T14:23:48-07:00","id":245651,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>ArcaneArts</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/232989-getting-dtd-prestige-edition?p=245369#post245369\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">GOD DAMNIT MINTY, WHAT DO YOU THINK I'M FUCKING TRYING TO DO?<br /> <br /> Blegh. I don't like this game, Minty, can we change the rules?</div> </div> </div> </div>Yes you can change the rules, but you have to bribe the storyteller with food and show at least two examples from previous works that contradict one another. <br /> There you go Shadowlost, but next time remember to flash your gun. <br /> On another note. I have nothing to report since the post doesn't run on Sundays. But one of our Deacons informed me that Gabriel is a Patron Saint of Postal workers So at least I can do something productive.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1064-miss_minty","name":"miss_minty","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"283"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-08-31T17:02:27-07:00","id":245700,"title":"","content":"Well, my copy is taking the long haul across the ocean from Miami to Australia, apparently.<br /> <br /> Could be anywhere from a week to a month, as international post is wont to be.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1462-xenesis","name":"Xenesis","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1462_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-09-01T03:08:01-07:00","id":246048,"title":"","content":"Ayup. My book is sitting in Miami right now. I didn't even know that was a real place. o.O","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/635-slaunyeh","name":"Slaunyeh","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar635_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"25"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-09-01T10:47:44-07:00","id":246233,"title":"","content":"Update. The Gods have smiled and the book didn't go to the geographic center of Texas. Like most people there is some damage, but it's just a small dent so I'm not overly concerned. Though that failed art class snowflake cardboard packaging did concern me when I saw it.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1110-unjustcustos","name":"UnjustCustos","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1110_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"46"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-09-01T23:10:48-07:00","id":246663,"title":"","content":"I also received my tracking number but I'm wondering. Is USPS sending shipments to europe via miami? (according to the tracker 2/3 of the transit are finished and yesterday it arrived in miami)","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/914-ryu","name":"Ryu","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"330"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-09-02T10:42:18-07:00","id":246937,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Hawthorn</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/232989-getting-dtd-prestige-edition?p=245286#post245286\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">In general I just want to say that we should stay positive! We either have or nearly have our deluxe copies of a game we all love.</div> </div> </div> </div>Here Here! That's the post I've been trying to voice but didn't find the right words. I don't feel like the majority of this thread is conveying the Awesome-ness of the book nor is it conveying how excited everyone is to be getting their copies <u><i>within the month</i></u>. I don't see many of the things people are complaining about to be all that big of issues.<br /> <br /> On a more on topic note: I am slated to receive mine on Thursday. I've already handed off my POD copy to my Co-ST and I almost feel like counting down the minutes till I get home on Thursday to see that shiny beast waiting for me!","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://www.kickstarter.com/projects/200664283/demon-the-descent-prestige-edition\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://img513.imageshack.us/img513/4478/8vno.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a><br /> Frequent Story Teller for the Circle of Five gaming group.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/654-xiongrey","name":"xiongrey","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar654_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"549"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-09-02T14:53:44-07:00","id":247137,"title":"","content":"Well I can't speak for others but my exasperation stemmed from July, becoming August, and now were supposed to celebrate that it's months+ late? Don't get me wrong, yay I get my books. However my excitement has waned considerably.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1064-miss_minty","name":"miss_minty","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"283"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-09-02T17:06:24-07:00","id":247259,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>miss_minty</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/232989-getting-dtd-prestige-edition?p=247137#post247137\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Well I can't speak for others but my exasperation stemmed from July, becoming August, and now were supposed to celebrate that it's months+ late? Don't get me wrong, yay I get my books. However my excitement has waned considerably.</div> </div> </div> </div>Eh, being that the estimated delivery on the Kickstarter was July 2014, and USA peeps started getting their copies August 2014 (and the rest of the world will likely be the first half of September!) I'd say they're pretty on time. And that's with some weirdo delays that we were all told about :P<br /> <br /> That being said, the USPS completely baffles me:<br /> <img src=\"http://puu.sh/bj2ZJ/be32f21768.png\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/><br /> <br /> Why? Why would you send a parcel back and forth twice between the same two places?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1462,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1462-xenesis","user":"Xenesis","date":". 09-02-2014, 08:42 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1462-xenesis","name":"Xenesis","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1462_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-09-02T17:18:36-07:00","id":247268,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>miss_minty</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/232989-getting-dtd-prestige-edition?p=247137#post247137\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Well I can't speak for others but my exasperation stemmed from July, becoming August, and now were supposed to celebrate that it's months+ late? Don't get me wrong, yay I get my books. However my excitement has waned considerably.</div> </div> </div> </div>I backed the Exalted 3e KS (over a year ago!) and have been <i>infinitely</i> more annoyed by the people complaining about it being late than its being late, not least because if nothing else I know the people complaining aren't contributing to the speedy completion of the material by doing so.<br /> <br /> It is <i>just possible</i> that I have enough on my plate already between books and games and anime and YouTube and rereading the entire nWoD that my perspective is somewhat distorted, but libraries and Netflix have been a thing for years and I don't have the time or energy to spare sorting venting from productive discussion, particularly when the former is better served being put on people's personal blogs or the Contact Us form or literally anywhere else where it's not out in public clogging up my feeds.<br /> <br /> But that's just me.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:trebuchet ms\"><span style=\"color:#4B0082\"><b>Resident Lore-Hound</b></span><br /> Currently Consuming: <i>Demon: the Descent 1e</i></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/111-satchel","name":"Satchel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar111_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9828"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-09-02T18:09:39-07:00","id":247307,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Satchel</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/232989-getting-dtd-prestige-edition?p=247268#post247268\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I backed the Exalted 3e KS (over a year ago!) and have been <i>infinitely</i> more annoyed by the people complaining about it being late than its being late, not least because if nothing else I know the people complaining aren't contributing to the speedy completion of the material by doing so.<br /> <br /> It is <i>just possible</i> that I have enough on my plate already between books and games and anime and YouTube and rereading the entire nWoD that my perspective is somewhat distorted, but libraries and Netflix have been a thing for years and I don't have the time or energy to spare sorting venting from productive discussion, particularly when the former is better served being put on people's personal blogs or the Contact Us form or literally anywhere else where it's not out in public clogging up my feeds.<br /> <br /> But that's just me.</div> </div> </div> </div>This is me 90% of the time.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Kelly R.S. Steele, Freelance Writer(Feel free to call me Kelly, Arcane, or Arc)</b><br /> The world is not beautiful, therefore it is.-Keiichi Sigsawa, Kino's Journey<br /> Feminine pronouns, please.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/99-arcanearts","name":"ArcaneArts","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar99_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11384"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-09-02T18:40:54-07:00","id":247318,"title":"","content":"Mine arrived today. Commendations to Onyx Path for making this a thing of beauty.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2233-agentwestmer","name":"Agentwestmer","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2233_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"394"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-09-02T19:38:35-07:00","id":247355,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Xenesis</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/232989-getting-dtd-prestige-edition?p=247259#post247259\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Eh, being that the estimated delivery on the Kickstarter was July 2014, and USA peeps started getting their copies August 2014 (and the rest of the world will likely be the first half of September!) I'd say they're pretty on time. And that's with some weirdo delays that we were all told about :P<br /> <br /> That being said, the USPS completely baffles me:<br /> <img src=\"http://puu.sh/bj2ZJ/be32f21768.png\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/><br /> <br /> Why? Why would you send a parcel back and forth twice between the same two places?</div> </div> </div> </div> Well I never intended to insinuate that I was being reasonable. Only why I'm not as exactly as excited as I was say back in July. But I'm the sort of person that expects everything to run on a strict time table. As for the post, you've got me. While on a walk with my daughter this morning I asked our mail carrier if I had gotten a package (I'm expecting DtD:RMD, HoH, and FoH) he said no and I went about my day. And towards the end, behold one of my books showed up. So the only sense you should expect anything for the States to make is nonsense.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1064-miss_minty","name":"miss_minty","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"283"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-09-03T10:40:04-07:00","id":247994,"title":"","content":"Got mine. Wonderful condition and looks awesome.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1250-shadowlost","name":"Shadowlost","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1250_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"155"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-09-03T13:13:25-07:00","id":248113,"title":"","content":"Mine says it left IL on the 29th, but hasn't been updated since. Arcane you're in Idaho as well, is your tracking saying the same thing?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1064-miss_minty","name":"miss_minty","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"283"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-09-03T13:19:01-07:00","id":248117,"title":"","content":"Mine updated earlier today and tells me it is actually here in Rexburg at the Post Office. Not due to ship til' tomorrow though, although I'm gonna walk over there and see if I can pick it up early.<br /> <br /> I expect yours to update later, although the fact it didn't stop off in Salt Lake yet is alarming.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Kelly R.S. Steele, Freelance Writer(Feel free to call me Kelly, Arcane, or Arc)</b><br /> The world is not beautiful, therefore it is.-Keiichi Sigsawa, Kino's Journey<br /> Feminine pronouns, please.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/99-arcanearts","name":"ArcaneArts","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar99_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11384"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-09-03T14:23:50-07:00","id":248145,"title":"","content":"I just got mine today, about on schedule as far as I'm concerned since kickstarters are always 3-6 months late in delivery. Must say I'm not really keen on these embossed covers. I can see what they are going for but it's way to reminiscent to me of the water-damaged cover of one of my other books.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1266-sirpants","name":"SirPants","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"54"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-09-03T14:39:57-07:00","id":248153,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>ArcaneArts</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/232989-getting-dtd-prestige-edition?p=248117#post248117\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Mine updated earlier today and tells me it is actually here in Rexburg at the Post Office. Not due to ship til' tomorrow though, although I'm gonna walk over there and see if I can pick it up early.<br /> <br /> I expect yours to update later, although the fact it didn't stop off in Salt Lake yet is alarming.</div> </div> </div> </div>I just checked again, it went straight from IL to Spokane. Which makes sense. I said earlier everything I get has to go to Spokane. If yours went to Salt lake First I assume that's just the closet ups waystation near you? Mine will likely head to the Annex in another near by city tomorrow than and be here by it's deadline on friday. I gotta admit, when you said it was alarming I got a huge knot in my chest. <br /> So should I post thong clad book porn? ^.~","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1064-miss_minty","name":"miss_minty","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"283"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-09-03T18:08:52-07:00","id":248328,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>miss_minty</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/232989-getting-dtd-prestige-edition?p=248153#post248153\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">So should I post thong clad book porn? ^.~</div> </div> </div> </div>Don't ask questions you already know the answer to!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/522-stupid-loserman","name":"Stupid Loserman","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar522_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1824"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-09-03T18:49:10-07:00","id":248355,"title":"","content":"If it didn't damage the book I could give Demon a helping of lipstick.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1064-miss_minty","name":"miss_minty","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"283"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-09-03T21:22:56-07:00","id":248492,"title":"","content":"Book tease.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1110-unjustcustos","name":"UnjustCustos","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1110_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"46"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-09-03T22:12:55-07:00","id":248553,"title":"","content":"Success! Book and screen arrived today in great condition. Book has a slight curvature to it along the covers, but I'm guessing that was a bindery issue and not something that happened during transit. I really like the embossing effect on the cover.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/361-brighthand","name":"Brighthand","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"13"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-09-03T22:51:33-07:00","id":248617,"title":"","content":"I had completely forgotten about the screen.... I didn't get mine in my order. Dagnabit.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1110-unjustcustos","name":"UnjustCustos","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1110_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"46"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-09-03T23:43:34-07:00","id":248662,"title":"","content":"Got both of my prestige editions and the screen in the mail today. There are some minor edge dents, but overall both are in excellent shape. I have to say they are extremely pretty books. It's hard to appreciate how good the typesetting is from the digital version. It is very good.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/737-campbell","name":"Campbell","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar737_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"8"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-09-04T06:54:42-07:00","id":248795,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Xenesis</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/232989-getting-dtd-prestige-edition?p=247259#post247259\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Why? Why would you send a parcel back and forth twice between the same two places?</div> </div> </div> </div>I think it's just how it sorts the list. If you look at the time stamps, I am guessing the 'departed Miami' and 'Arrived at NY' have the same time stamp, so they just didn't get listed in the correct order. At least that's what my trace looks like.<br /> <br /> Also, hooray, got the book yesterday!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/635-slaunyeh","name":"Slaunyeh","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar635_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"25"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-09-04T07:20:24-07:00","id":248801,"title":"","content":"Got mine yesterday a day earlier than expected. No visible damage. Nice and shiny.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/463-derendel","name":"Derendel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar463_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"39"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-09-04T07:30:41-07:00","id":248827,"title":"","content":"My book currently has a &quot;Destination Scan&quot; is in the City. I wonder if it will come in today.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1064-miss_minty","name":"miss_minty","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"283"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-09-04T13:46:55-07:00","id":249119,"title":"","content":"The book came yesterday in the post, and my first impression goes along the lines of: Gosh, that book is shiny! With that luster, the embossing comes across as so, so wonderfully subtle that it almost looks like an illusion. I'm actually a little afraid to really use this book much less touch it very long from fear of making a mess of it.<br /> <br /> To everyone involved in getting it made and to me, I say: Well done! Its quality just blows me away.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>B.I.G. Bird spreads the word: Anybody with a heart votes love<br /> <a href=\"https://absintheandthorns.obsidianportal.com/\" target=\"_blank\">https://absintheandthorns.obsidianportal.com/</a></i>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/409-phaolan","name":"Phaolan","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar409_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"478"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-09-04T14:01:22-07:00","id":249146,"title":"","content":"So, I got my book today, and a few things.<br /> <br /> 1)Do not use this book to reflect the sun, it will get in your eyes and it will hurt. Trufacs.<br /> <br /> 2)THe boxing of this was, indeed, very poor. The edges were popped up enough I could see my friend's face through it,and the paper thingy surrounding it was torn.<br /> <br /> 3)Appropo to that, my book does indeed have corner damage. Unlike everyone else though, that doesn't bother me personally, as even when I bought Changeling ages ago it had corner damage. I'm comfortable with it myself and don't fault anyone for that.<br /> <br /> But Onyx Path has their reputation to consider, as does the shipper, so you should at least know.<br /> <br /> 4)QUestion: I couldn't find anything implicitly about this, but weren't the pages supposed to be silver-lined like V20? Cause it was, mine isn't. I don't think it was promised though, so no explicit worry.<br /> <br /> Other than that last point, which might be me losing my mind, I'm happy. THe book is pretty damn sexy, even with the damage.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Kelly R.S. Steele, Freelance Writer(Feel free to call me Kelly, Arcane, or Arc)</b><br /> The world is not beautiful, therefore it is.-Keiichi Sigsawa, Kino's Journey<br /> Feminine pronouns, please.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/99-arcanearts","name":"ArcaneArts","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar99_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11384"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-09-04T14:40:15-07:00","id":249178,"title":"","content":"So, no book despite it being in town. Here's the message I received on my tracking tough.<br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"><b>As requested by the sender, UPS has transferred this shipment to the local post office for delivery to the final destination.<br /> <br /> I hate this shipper. I seriously hate them. I will never Kickstart another product for OP. </b></span></span><br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1064-miss_minty","name":"miss_minty","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"283"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-09-04T14:46:05-07:00","id":249182,"title":"","content":"I got that yesterday. It's actually something UPS does, not the shipper.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Kelly R.S. Steele, Freelance Writer(Feel free to call me Kelly, Arcane, or Arc)</b><br /> The world is not beautiful, therefore it is.-Keiichi Sigsawa, Kino's Journey<br /> Feminine pronouns, please.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/99-arcanearts","name":"ArcaneArts","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar99_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11384"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-09-04T14:49:53-07:00","id":249183,"title":"","content":"<b>But I called, they won't sort through packages until tomorrow. They don't plan on me getting my package until sometime next week.</b>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1064-miss_minty","name":"miss_minty","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"283"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-09-04T14:51:37-07:00","id":249185,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>ArcaneArts</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/232989-getting-dtd-prestige-edition?p=249146#post249146\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">So, I got my book today, and a few things.<br /> <br /> 1)Do not use this book to reflect the sun, it will get in your eyes and it will hurt. Trufacs.<br /> <br /> 2)THe boxing of this was, indeed, very poor. The edges were popped up enough I could see my friend's face through it,and the paper thingy surrounding it was torn.<br /> <br /> 3)Appropo to that, my book does indeed have corner damage. Unlike everyone else though, that doesn't bother me personally, as even when I bought Changeling ages ago it had corner damage. I'm comfortable with it myself and don't fault anyone for that.<br /> <br /> But Onyx Path has their reputation to consider, as does the shipper, so you should at least know.<br /> <br /> 4)QUestion: I couldn't find anything implicitly about this, but weren't the pages supposed to be silver-lined like V20? Cause it was, mine isn't. I don't think it was promised though, so no explicit worry.<br /> <br /> Other than that last point, which might be me losing my mind, I'm happy. THe book is pretty damn sexy, even with the damage.</div> </div> </div> </div>Nah, the silver gilding wasn't a KS goal with this book.. the mummy book was gold gilded though.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\"><a href=\"http://www.nodiatis.com/personality.htm\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://www.nodiatis.com/pub/21.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a></div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2451-windrave","name":"Windrave","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2451_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"85"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-09-04T14:59:56-07:00","id":249189,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Windrave</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/232989-getting-dtd-prestige-edition?p=249185#post249185\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Nah, the silver gilding wasn't a KS goal with this book.. the mummy book was gold gilded though.</div> </div> </div> </div>I thought that was the case.<br /> <br /> @Minty: Wow, that <i>really</i> sucks.<br /> <br /> But, with all understanding, I think that was a matter of chance.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Kelly R.S. Steele, Freelance Writer(Feel free to call me Kelly, Arcane, or Arc)</b><br /> The world is not beautiful, therefore it is.-Keiichi Sigsawa, Kino's Journey<br /> Feminine pronouns, please.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/99-arcanearts","name":"ArcaneArts","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar99_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11384"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-09-04T15:02:16-07:00","id":249191,"title":"","content":"I'm just really glad I have church twice before Monday comes.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1064-miss_minty","name":"miss_minty","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"283"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-09-04T15:11:58-07:00","id":249197,"title":"","content":"In OP's defense, they have not used this shipper before... and were forced to change shippers at the last minute. I hope your book comes in good condition Minty.. for all the frustration its caused you. But personally, I hope they find a different shipper before long.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\"><a href=\"http://www.nodiatis.com/personality.htm\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://www.nodiatis.com/pub/21.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a></div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2451-windrave","name":"Windrave","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2451_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"85"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-09-04T15:44:47-07:00","id":249219,"title":"","content":"News from good old Blighty.<br /> <br /> Got mine today. Not a single dent, scratch or impression. Even the corners of the ST screen I ordered were not bent!<br /> <br /> Generally I'm very impressed. The shipper took 6 days and this book is in mint condition.<br /> <br /> Feel kinda sorry for the people in the USA who still don't have their's I was sure I would be one of the last people to get mine due to be an international buyer.<br /> <br /> Don't know if its just me or is the book feel really heavy for other people? I compared the weight to the Deluxe Mummy book I have and their is a noticeable difference. Though that might just be the 150+ pages more that Demon has.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#0000cd\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><i>&quot;There is no God in the Badlands.&quot; </i></span></span></span><span style=\"font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">- Sunny</span></span><br /> <br /> <img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.com/a/img824/1346/mosz.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /> <img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.com/a/img41/8167/obcp.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/599-hawthorn","name":"Hawthorn","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar599_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"511"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-09-04T17:25:58-07:00","id":249315,"title":"","content":"It's 3.7 lbs according to the tracker. It's a heavy duty book.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3776-autodefenestrate","name":"AutoDefenestrate","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3776_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"120"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-09-04T18:00:26-07:00","id":249329,"title":"","content":"Folks, if there is a problem with your shipments, posting here doesn't really give me anything to work with. Please use the Contact Me button under my picture on the Kickstarter page so I can connect your problem with your backer info and see if our fulfillment service can find out what the shippers are doing. Riley Life is a fulfillment shipping service that uses the same avenues for individual shipping that you'd imagine: USPS, UPS, etc, so while they can't control how those shippers actually handle the packages, they can demand explanations.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5-richt","name":"RichT","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5_2.jpeg","title":"Onyx Path Creative Director","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"505"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-09-04T18:06:59-07:00","id":249331,"title":"","content":"Thanks for reminding us, and sorry about the inconvenience.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Kelly R.S. Steele, Freelance Writer(Feel free to call me Kelly, Arcane, or Arc)</b><br /> The world is not beautiful, therefore it is.-Keiichi Sigsawa, Kino's Journey<br /> Feminine pronouns, please.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/99-arcanearts","name":"ArcaneArts","avatar":"https://forum.th