osts:","value":"967"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-09-05T07:50:42-07:00","id":249810,"title":"","content":"Mine arrived! Well, it actually arrived yesterday but I was out, and I went to pick it up from the post office today.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"color:#000000\"><b>Dave Brookshaw</b></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/14-dave-brookshaw","name":"Dave Brookshaw","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar14_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2081"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-09-05T13:15:36-07:00","id":250083,"title":"","content":"Mine arrived today, so they've definitely reached the UK. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> Funnily enough, my signed copy of Machinae Supremacy's latest album arrived at the same time. Some of the songs on it actually fit Demon pretty well.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1218-taejix","name":"Taejix","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"27"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-09-05T14:53:37-07:00","id":250152,"title":"","content":"Mine is still in the post office Infrastructure, no word on when it will be released. How are people liking the ST Screen? The only other screen I've gotten was Mage so I'm curious how this one stacks up. I know they're three panel and the material is different but I mean what kind of content is displayed?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1064-miss_minty","name":"miss_minty","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"283"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-09-05T15:22:49-07:00","id":250180,"title":"","content":"I got mine yesterday. I am very happy with the ST screen. It's lighter and doesn't try to close on you which is excellent (that was my biggest problem with the old ST Screens).<br /> <br /> The book itself is beautiful. the corner is bent but I expected that and don't really have that much of a problem. I am overwhelmingly happy with it and I can't wait to take it to the next gaming session. I do a daily picture thing on instagram/FaceBook where I post a picture of whatever made me happy that day. The Prestige Edition took the spotlight! Thanks OP and I can't wait for the Beast Kickstarter next year (please Kickstart it!)","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://www.kickstarter.com/projects/200664283/demon-the-descent-prestige-edition\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://img513.imageshack.us/img513/4478/8vno.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a><br /> Frequent Story Teller for the Circle of Five gaming group.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/654-xiongrey","name":"xiongrey","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar654_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"549"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-09-06T09:45:11-07:00","id":250823,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>miss_minty</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/232989-getting-dtd-prestige-edition?p=250152#post250152\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Mine is still in the post office Infrastructure...</div> </div> </div> </div>I cannot in good conscience let this go without a comment of how perfect it is! I dunno that you're the first to say such a thing, but dang, this game as changed how I look at the world in very odd ways. I am NOT complaining, mind you!","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>B.I.G. Bird spreads the word: Anybody with a heart votes love<br /> <a href=\"https://absintheandthorns.obsidianportal.com/\" target=\"_blank\">https://absintheandthorns.obsidianportal.com/</a></i>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/409-phaolan","name":"Phaolan","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar409_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"478"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-09-07T19:58:54-07:00","id":251881,"title":"","content":"Mine showed up!<br /> <br /> <img src=\"http://puu.sh/bqedI/08e54421f4.jpg\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/><br /> <br /> (Excuse the potato camera)<br /> <br /> Looks great (although minor damage on the book from postage) and feels great in hands. Screen is lovely, although the cat chewed the corner within about 5 seconds. \u00ac_\u00ac (Darn cryptids!)","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1462-xenesis","name":"Xenesis","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1462_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-09-08T00:30:19-07:00","id":252047,"title":"","content":"I got mine, all the way in Australia! I am well pleased and there doesn't seem to be any damage at all. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3036-desolatedolly","name":"DesolateDolly","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3036_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"179"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-09-08T19:30:09-07:00","id":252889,"title":"","content":"Mine arrived in Australia yesterday.<br /> 1 bent corner and 1 page (around page 300 or so) with a dog ear and slight tear.<br /> <br /> I have had books arrive in better and worse condition so no real complaints.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/142-thiassi","name":"Thiassi","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar142_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"25"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-09-09T04:43:49-07:00","id":253228,"title":"","content":"Just got back from Europe to a big fat package with my prestige editions and screens, what can I say? Its starting to feel a bit like xmas here in sunny Cali <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/image