says I should have had it last friday the USPS disagrees.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1064-miss_minty","name":"miss_minty","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"283"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-09-10T12:35:02-07:00","id":254285,"title":"","content":"Aaaarrrggghhh; I am raging with jealousy. I was in the process of moving while i put in for the kickstart so i sent it to my mom's, so even when she gets it i'll have to wait a day or so be for i actuality have it. Here;'s hoping for the end of the week tops before it's in my hands.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/252-basketcase","name":"basketcase","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar252_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"139"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-09-12T15:02:05-07:00","id":255607,"title":"","content":"I finally got mine, it took way way longer than it should have. Minor damage to the upper left corners of each book. Must be printing. Really disappointed with the screen though. Two thirds of it is all combat related and the only thing Demon about is the Compromise?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1064-miss_minty","name":"miss_minty","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"283"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-09-13T02:00:10-07:00","id":255918,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>miss_minty</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/232989-getting-dtd-prestige-edition?p=255607#post255607\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I finally got mine, it took way way longer than it should have. Minor damage to the upper left corners of each book. Must be printing. Really disappointed with the screen though. Two thirds of it is all combat related and the only thing Demon about is the Compromise?</div> </div> </div> </div>I'm <i>especially</i> happy with the screen, cause it get's me common mechanics of <b>Storyteller System 2nd Edition</b>, so I could use this screen for coming <b>Demon</b> game, but also on tomorrow <b>Werewolf</b> and our <b>Mage</b> game in next week. And <b>Demon</b> screen cover is very &quot;general WoD&quot; in it's feel to reuse it. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" /> It's also very hard and well made, so it will last longer.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-09-13T08:24:28-07:00","id":256050,"title":"","content":"Materials are fine, but a game that isn't about combat doesn't need an already simplified combat system taking over everything related to the screen. At least I don't think so. Aside from the grapple rules which are as about as confusing as the one's In Lunch Money. I just don't think I'd ever need this screen at the table.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1064-miss_minty","name":"miss_minty","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"283"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}